{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/jp/ep1/quest_story/11209010.json":{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11209010","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11209010","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1120901001:0":{"text":"ふぅ……もう安全になったの？","source_cn":"呼……现在是不是安全了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x852228060921401B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120901002:0":{"text":"バードマウントに乗って襲ってきた奴らのせいで、追い風商隊の仲間たちが散り散りになっちゃったの！幸い私はここに隠れることができたけど……","source_cn":"那些骑陆行鸟劫掠的混蛋……行进之风商队的同伴都被他们冲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC8E82D5783B8B3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1120901003:0":{"text":"回りに散らばってる火薬は好きに持ってっていいわよ。奪われて残った物ばかりで、売り物にはならないから……","source_cn":"你要是在周围看到散落的火药，就拿去用吧。都是被抢剩下的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AC419086C80C0EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120901004:0":{"text":"ありがとね、通りすがりの旅人さん。私も商隊の仲間を探しに行かなくちゃ。ジョワンニたちが無事だといいけど。","source_cn":"路过的朋友，谢谢你，我得赶快去找失散的商队成员了，希望...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8D67E7FE7DDA31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:塞拉菲娜":{"text":"セラフィーナ","source":"塞拉菲娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}}}